Your COROS connection in Quantified Self can now do more.

You can send activities and routes from Quantified Self to your COROS account—manually when you choose, or automatically from supported connected services.

These changes are available in Quantified Self v10.11.0.

Activities
- Upload a FIT activity file directly to COROS.
- Automatically send new FIT activities from Garmin, Suunto, or Wahoo.
- Use Sync past activities to send a selected date range already stored in Quantified Self without enabling automatic delivery for future activities.

Routes
- Upload a GPX or FIT route directly to COROS.
- Send saved routes from Quantified Self individually or in bulk.
- If you use Suunto, automatically send new and updated Suunto routes saved in Quantified Self—or send your existing routes once without enabling future delivery.


You remain in control
All automatic delivery options are off by default. Nothing is forwarded until you explicitly enable a direction or start an upload. These tools require Pro and active service connections.

